{
  "case_id": "2021-20-827",
  "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Brian H. Fletcher",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0000-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Our nation's covert intelligence partnerships depend on our partners' trust that we will keep those relationships confidential."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Brian H. Fletcher",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0000-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Respondents seek discovery that would compel a breach of that trust by confirming or denying the existence of an alleged CIA facility in Poland, and Respondents seek that discovery not to vindicate any rights under U.S. law but, instead, in a discretionary Section 1782 application aimed at sending evidence abroad to a foreign investigation whose very purpose is to reveal and prosecute the alleged involvement of Polish officials in covert CIA activities."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0000-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: The two contractors have testified about the treatment of detainees before, right?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Fletcher",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 24,
        "start": 24
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Ultimately, of course, our view would still be that the executive's national security judgment is entitled to deference, and if, under that deferential standard, the court agrees that the disclosure would harm national security, then that evidence could not be disclosed."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 29,
        "start": 29
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAVANAUGH: To what extent is the privilege a constitutional privilege? And to what extent do you think the privilege is a common law privilege that could be altered by Congress?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0006",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 32,
        "start": 32
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: Mr. Fletcher, should we be thinking about this as a Reynolds case or a -- an Intel case?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 36,
        "start": 36
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE GORSUCH: Mr. Fletcher, do we start on an agreed premise that the government bears the burden of proving the privilege up?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Klein",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0001-0004",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 42,
        "start": 42
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Let me start by making one thing clear. I'm not planning to ask did it happen in Poland. The Polish prosecutor already has information about that and doesn't need U.S. discovery on the topic."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 44,
        "start": 44
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: Mr. Klein, you said that much of this has already been disclosed. If it has been, what -- why do you need additional testimony?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. KLEIN",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 46,
        "start": 46
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "under Polish law, Abu Zubaydah has particular rights to -- frankly, to stand as an accuser of those who -- who have assaulted him. That's -- that's a feature of Polish law. Not only can he be a complainant, but he can submit evidence to the prosecutor, and -- and if the prosecutor declines to go forward with the prosecution, he has a right of appeal in Poland as well. He can appeal to a court."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 48,
        "start": 48
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE BARRETT: So you don't need them for that?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 57,
        "start": 57
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: Mr. Klein, am I -- I think I understand, because you're held in Guantanamo, you're not permitted to sign affidavits or give any testimony, correct?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0002-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 64,
        "start": 64
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Can this whole thing be boiled down into much simpler terms? Is it correct that what you want in the -- in the end is a more official link between what happened and Poland?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 65,
        "start": 65
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Well, you know -- you say you know what happened, and what you want to add is where it happened, right? That's the link. That's what this all boils down to."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 69,
        "start": 69
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: Does -- does -- is that in the end what your argument depends on, that we should treat the contractors differently from an employee? If -- if these people were current employees, would your entire argument go up in smoke?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 74,
        "start": 74
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Will the government make Petitioner available to testify as to his treatment during these dates?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Fletcher",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "d242b06a673cdd9762d4df6a09b3cffa87a33825e92f9c08d53a693dab2e5fc4",
      "evidence_id": "ev-d242b06a673c-0003-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 75,
        "start": 75
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Our position as to all communications by Abu Zubaydah is that he can communicate subject to security screening, which would include -- and I just want to be clear -- would include eliminating classified information."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Source extraction",
      "case_id": "2021-20-827",
